	"TagLine": "The \"Monster Prom\" entry of my Spooncrows series. ",
	"Description": "Hi hello, I'm Spooner, and I've been making some Scarecrows. I tried my best to capture the style and personality of each character within the limitations that 16x32 pixels allows.  \n\nUpdates will be pseudo-infrequent, and will be spurred by errors that you fine people catch, or things that catch my eye as I'm playing that I'm unhappy with. I may also add more characters, but these will take time, and will be even more random than the updates.  \n\nThank you for listening to my short ramble, and I hope you enjoy yourself some Spooncrows.  \n\n-Spooner",
